Command script to complete the 350-point game
---------------------------------------------
Note that the final score is 5 points short because the nodwarves command
is used.   Note also that this walkthrough makes use of information which
you would have to obtain from a previous game - for example, the magic word
to enter the cave is used before you've seen it.  Some game features aren't
included (e.g. obtaining new batteries for your lamp)

